{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "LEV",
 "chapter": 21,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.21.1",
   "range": "LEV.21.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0bef9ae0",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.1#p1-0bef9ae0",
     "text": "By touching the dead, lamenting, or being at their burial.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "defiled for the dead among his"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.21.3",
   "range": "LEV.21.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "59e430ff",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.3#p1-59e430ff",
     "text": "For being married she seemed to be cut off from his family.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "virgin"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.21.4",
   "range": "LEV.21.4",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "27b4c368",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.4#p1-27b4c368",
     "text": "The priest was permitted to mourn for his next kindred only.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "chief man among his people"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.21.7",
   "range": "LEV.21.7",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0c57f5cc",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.7#p1-0c57f5cc",
     "text": "Which has an evil name or is defamed.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "profane"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.21.8",
   "range": "LEV.21.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5f581a81",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.8#p1-f8d5ece6",
     "text": "You shall count them holy and reverence them.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "sanctify him therefore"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.8#p2-a921e553",
     "text": "The showbread.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "bread of thy God"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.21.10",
   "range": "LEV.21.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a9b4009c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.10#p1-a9b4009c",
     "text": "He shall use no such ceremonies as the mourners observed.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "uncover his head"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.21.12",
   "range": "LEV.21.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5c0031e9",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.12#p1-cba24675",
     "text": "To go to the dead.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "sanctuary"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.12#p2-6f49b793",
     "text": "For by his anointing he was preferred above the other priests and therefore could not lament the dead, least he should have polluted his holy anointing.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "crown of the anointing oil of"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.21.14",
   "range": "LEV.21.14",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b1f48151",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.14#p1-b1f48151",
     "text": "Not only of his tribe, but of all Israel.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "people to wife"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.21.15",
   "range": "LEV.21.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "99ada787",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.15#p1-99ada787",
     "text": "By marrying any unchaste or defamed woman.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "seed among his people"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.21.18",
   "range": "LEV.21.18",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "4029a588",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.18#p1-00185295",
     "text": "Which is deformed or bruised.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "a flat nose"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.18#p2-1c663ff8",
     "text": "As not of equal proportion, or having in number more or less.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "thing superfluous"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.21.20",
   "range": "LEV.21.20",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c364a553",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.20#p1-c364a553",
     "text": "Or that has a web or pearl.",
     "label": "o",
     "anchor": "or that hath a blemish in"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.21.21",
   "range": "LEV.21.21",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "56d9cfaf",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.21#p1-56d9cfaf",
     "text": "As the show bread, and meat offerings.",
     "label": "p",
     "anchor": "bread of his God"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.21.22",
   "range": "LEV.21.22",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "24d508fe",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.22#p1-e6655930",
     "text": "As of sacrifice for sin.",
     "label": "q",
     "anchor": "most holy"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.22#p2-3e800cdc",
     "text": "As of the tithes and first fruits.",
     "label": "r",
     "anchor": "of the holy"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.21.23",
   "range": "LEV.21.23",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "6955e80c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.21.23#p1-6955e80c",
     "text": "Into the sanctuary.",
     "label": "s",
     "anchor": "vail"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
